<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Form 04</title><style>@page{size:A4;margin:10mm 12mm 16mm;@bottom-center{content:"Bloomwell Home Care Uganda Limited · Nest Mama Program · Page " counter(page) " of " counter(pages);font:7pt Arial,sans-serif;color:#47615E}}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#0B2E2A;font-size:8.5pt;line-height:1.35}
.hd{background:#08675F;color:#fff;padding:3mm 5mm;border-bottom:1.4mm solid #F8991E}.hd table{width:100%}.hd td{vertical-align:middle}.hd .n{font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold}.hd .s{font-size:7pt;color:#CFEAE5}.hd .r{text-align:right;font-size:7pt;color:#CFEAE5}
.tt{border:.3mm solid #08675F;background:#DDF0EC;padding:2.5mm 3mm;margin:3mm 0}.tt b{font-size:12pt;color:#08675F}.tt div{font-size:7.5pt;color:#47615E;margin-top:1mm}
h3{font-size:9pt;color:#08675F;margin:4mm 0 1.5mm;border-bottom:.3mm solid #F8991E;padding-bottom:.8mm;break-after:avoid}
table.r{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:2mm 0;margin:0 -2mm}table.r{table-layout:fixed}
.c{vertical-align:bottom;padding-top:1.5mm}.l{display:block;font-size:6.8pt;color:#47615E}.v{display:block;border-bottom:.25mm solid #7F9A96;min-height:5.5mm;font-size:8.5pt;font-weight:bold}
.w{margin-top:1.5mm;break-inside:avoid}.w .v{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;border-bottom:.25mm solid #7F9A96;min-height:11mm;padding:1mm 1.5mm;font-weight:normal;background:#FBFDFC}
.cb{margin-top:1.8mm;break-inside:avoid}.cb .o{display:inline-block;margin:0 4mm 0 0;font-size:8.5pt}.cb .l{display:inline;margin-right:3mm;font-size:8pt;color:#0B2E2A;font-weight:bold}
.n{border:.3mm solid #E0B25A;background:#FFF6E3;padding:2mm 3mm;margin-top:2.5mm;font-size:7.8pt;break-inside:avoid}
p.t{margin:2mm 0;font-size:8.3pt;break-inside:avoid}
table.g{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:2mm;table-layout:fixed;break-inside:avoid}.g th{background:#08675F;color:#fff;font-size:6.8pt;padding:1.4mm;text-align:left}.g td{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;height:7.5mm;padding:.5mm 1.5mm;font-size:8pt}.g tr:nth-child(even) td{background:#F2F8F6}
table.s{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:3mm;table-layout:fixed;break-inside:avoid}.s th{background:#E8F2F0;font-size:6.8pt;text-align:left;padding:1.2mm;border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5}.s td{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;padding:1.2mm;vertical-align:top;height:15mm;font-size:7.8pt}
.s .m{font-size:6.8pt;line-height:1.5}.si{max-height:10mm;display:block}.ev{font-size:6pt;color:#47615E;margin-top:.8mm}
.idr{margin-top:1mm}thead{display:table-header-group}tr{break-inside:avoid}</style></head><body><div class="hd"><table><tr><td style="width:14mm">{{ org.mark_svg|safe }}</td><td><div class="n">BLOOMWELL HOME CARE UGANDA LIMITED</div><div class="s">Patient consent and care forms · Nest Mama Program · You rest, we care</div></td><td class="r">{{ org.city }}, Uganda<br>{{ org.phone }}</td></tr></table></div><div class="tt"><b>FORM 04. SPECIFIC PROCEDURE CONSENT</b><div>Record consent to an identified procedure or a clearly described course of repeated care. Completed by the practitioner before the procedure. A signature does not replace the discussion. Reconfirm consent before each attendance.</div></div><table class="r idr"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Patient full name</span><span class="v">{{ patient.name }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">DOB / age</span><span class="v">{{ patient.dob }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Patient record ID</span><span class="v">{{ patient.record_id }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Date / time</span><span class="v">{{ form.datetime }}</span></td></tr></table><div class="w"><span class="l">Procedure and clinical reason; site / side where applicable</span><span class="v">{{ v.procedure_and_clinical_reason_site_side_ or prefill.procedure_and_clinical_reason_site_side_ }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Practitioner and required clinical order / prescription reference</span><span class="v">{{ v.practitioner_and_required_clinical_order or prefill.practitioner_and_required_clinical_order }}</span></div><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Proposed date, or course duration and frequency</span><span class="v">{{ v.proposed_date_or_course_duration_and_fre or prefill.proposed_date_or_course_duration_and_fre }}</span></td></tr></table><div class="w"><span class="l">Expected benefits and patient-specific material risks</span><span class="v">{{ v.expected_benefits_and_patient_specific_m or prefill.expected_benefits_and_patient_specific_m }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Alternatives and consequences of delaying or declining</span><span class="v">{{ v.alternatives_and_consequences_of_delayin or prefill.alternatives_and_consequences_of_delayin }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Preparation, pain management, aftercare and warning signs explained</span><span class="v">{{ v.preparation_pain_management_aftercare_an or prefill.preparation_pain_management_aftercare_an }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Questions, answers and restrictions requested by the patient</span><span class="v">{{ v.questions_answers_and_restrictions_reque or prefill.questions_answers_and_restrictions_reque }}</span></div><div class="cb"><span class="l">Capacity / authority:</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.capacity_authority == "Patient" else "☐" }} Patient</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.capacity_authority == "Verified representative (or parent " else "☐" }} Verified representative (or parent </span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.capacity_authority == " guardian of a patient under 18)" else "☐" }}  guardian of a patient under 18)</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">If representative: name and authority evidence / reference</span><span class="v">{{ v.if_representative_name_and_authority_evi or prefill.if_representative_name_and_authority_evi }}</span></div><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Interpreter / support used</span><span class="v">{{ v.interpreter_support_used or prefill.interpreter_support_used }}</span></td></tr></table><h3>Declaration</h3><p class="t">I understand the procedure described above and voluntarily agree to it, subject to my recorded restrictions. I may ask for it to stop or withdraw consent. Any necessary safe stopping steps will be explained. This consent does not authorise unrelated procedures or waive my rights.</p><h3>Signatures</h3><table class="s"><tr><th style="width:27mm">Role</th><th style="width:44mm">Name and details</th><th style="width:30mm">Method</th><th>Signature or thumbprint, with e-signature evidence</th><th style="width:24mm">Date / time</th></tr><tr><td><b>Patient or authorised representative</b><div class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.client.esign else "☐" }} I agree to sign electronically</div></td><td>{{ sig.client.name or patient.name }}<div class="m">Name, capacity / role</div><div>{{ sig.client.detail }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.client.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.client.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.client.method == "password" else "☐" }} Passphrase<br>{{ "☒" if sig.client.method == "thumbprint" else "☐" }} Thumbprint<br></td><td>{% if sig.client.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.client.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.client.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.client.at }}</td></tr><tr><td><b>Interpreter or reader (if used)</b></td><td>{{ sig.interpreter.name }}<div class="m">Name, address, language</div><div>{{ sig.interpreter.detail }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.interpreter.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.interpreter.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.interpreter.method == "password" else "☐" }} Passphrase<br>{{ "☒" if sig.interpreter.method == "thumbprint" else "☐" }} Thumbprint<br></td><td>{% if sig.interpreter.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.interpreter.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.interpreter.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.interpreter.at }}</td></tr><tr><td><b>Witness (recommended)</b></td><td>{{ sig.witness.name }}<div class="m">Name and role</div><div>{{ sig.witness.detail }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.witness.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.witness.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.witness.method == "password" else "☐" }} Passphrase<br>{{ "☒" if sig.witness.method == "thumbprint" else "☐" }} Thumbprint<br></td><td>{% if sig.witness.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.witness.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.witness.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.witness.at }}</td></tr><tr><td><b>Clinician</b></td><td>{{ sig.nurse.name or author.name }}<div class="m">Name and UNMC number</div><div>{{ sig.nurse.detail or author.registration_line }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "password" else "☐" }} Account password<br></td><td>{% if sig.nurse.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.nurse.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.nurse.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.nurse.at }}</td></tr></table><h3>Confirmation immediately before the procedure</h3><div class="cb"><span class="l">Identity and site checked:</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.identity_and_site_checked == "Yes" else "☐" }} Yes</span></div><div class="cb"><span class="l">Current consent confirmed:</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.current_consent_confirmed == "Yes" else "☐" }} Yes</span></div><div class="cb"><span class="l">Relevant order, allergies, equipment and safety checks completed:</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.relevant_order_allergies_equipment_and_s == "Yes" else "☐" }} Yes</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Changes since discussion and action taken</span><span class="v">{{ v.changes_since_discussion_and_action_take or prefill.changes_since_discussion_and_action_take }}</span></div><div class="cb"><span class="l">Proceed:</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.proceed == "Yes" else "☐" }} Yes</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.proceed == "No" else "☐" }} No</span></div><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Practitioner initials</span><span class="v">{{ v.practitioner_initials or prefill.practitioner_initials }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Date / time</span><span class="v">{{ v.date_time or prefill.date_time }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Visit sheet (Form 07) reference</span><span class="v">{{ v.visit_sheet_form_07_reference or prefill.visit_sheet_form_07_reference }}</span></td></tr></table></body></html>